cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference ADRIAN in writing or derivative work, please cite it as below."
title: "ADRIAN — AI-Driven, Request-Intelligent, Agentic eNgineering"
abstract: >
  An open source software development framework born at Disruptica for small,
  self-managing teams where AI agents produce most of the code and humans own
  intent, judgment, and accountability. Built around a four-phase loop (Align,
  Implement, Deliver, Adapt) and an in-app requirements bot (BugLady) as the
  requirements spine. The unit of work is the Request, born from a BugLady chat interview. Flexes across unregulated and regulated domains via a compliance
  mode overlay.
type: software
